    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A novella exploring how color and shapes influence the perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story about how the mind\u2019s defenses can become destructive for a person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426300/extras/8d78ea79d03bca548af36c393d96d36f.avif?t=1746188043\" width=636 height=84 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short duration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style inspired by the works of abstract artists</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A novella exploring how color and shapes influence the perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story about how the mind\u2019s defenses can become destructive for a person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426300/extras/8d78ea79d03bca548af36c393d96d36f.avif?t=1746188043\" width=636 height=84 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short duration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style inspired by the works of abstract artists</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A patchwork quilt of meanings, ideas, references, and madness. A crack in the sink of your understanding. And also the story of one unfortunate girl.",
